        <item>
            <title>1.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:53:21 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.3.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Lina is now available in German. Pick it in Settings, General, or let Lina follow your Mac's language.</li>
<li>Incoming calls now reach Lina reliably behind a router or a VPN: Lina keeps the connection to your provider open between registrations.</li>
<li>Hanging up a call yourself before it is answered no longer shows « Call failed ».</li>
<li>Settings, Network: the REGISTER expiry field no longer shows its value twice.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
